Name Antarctica Note #1

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Barry Reginaldius's Journal
Interactability_Text_Line_1 Entry 2371
Interactability_Text_Line_2 It's been 7 years since the Queen's orders came through and sent me t'this damned place
Interactability_Text_Line_3 I've been cooped up for God knows how long, yeah, and I'm goin' bloody mental! Loony!
Interactability_Text_Line_4 I've got no news on what's happenin' back home on the Isles, one of my flatmates told me London got bombed!
Interactability_Text_Line_5 But you know what, I might as well believe 'em, yeah? I got nothin' to lose by doin so, yeah? Ridiculous!
Interactability_Text_Line_6 How much longer until I get away from this insane continent, and get to see me family? 
Interactability_Text_Line_7 I'm lookin' forward to havin' some ciggies with the lads, and sittin' down in my favorite pub for a wicked English Breakfast.
Interactability_Text_Line_8 God Save the Queen, and may she get me back home soon!